# Migrations

Alembic reads `BOLINGO_DATABASE_URL` (via `app.config`) and the models in
`app/models.py`; there is no database URL in `alembic.ini`.

```bash
# Apply every migration
.venv/Scripts/python -m alembic upgrade head

# New migration after changing a model
.venv/Scripts/python -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

# Adopt an existing zero-config database (created by create_all)
.venv/Scripts/python -m alembic stamp head
```

The app still calls `create_all` on startup so `uvicorn app.main:app` works
with zero configuration; use migrations for any real deployment.
